{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c3eb","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0aece-231f-7991-85b6-ba6bca7c9720"},"sequence":80,"recorded_at":1780531400000155,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"e70d9852-000b-4121-b33e-b53bebd87eae","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"e70d9852-000b-4121-b33e-b53bebd87eae","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"e70d9852-000b-4121-b33e-b53bebd87eae"},"call_id":"call_01a0aece37dc76449fa299472f6ddb89","text":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/resources/TASK-260830-2x16gz/TASK-260830-2x16gz_producer.md`.\n1|Own TASK-260830-2x16gz (test-peer-auth-and-hostile-network-failures), the FINAL leaf of STORY-260830-1kiyj6 (peer-configuration-and-authentication). Predecessors on the Story branch, all accepted and checkpointed: 2u34k1 (host/peer identity), 1tvg8e (SSH transport and command boundary), 2ez769 (internal/hosttrust credentials, enrollment, rotation/revocation, authorization generations, Config-4 migration; ResolvedPaths pair), z1yxg9 (internal/rpcwire RPC 5.0.0 and internal/hostchannel Host Channel 1.0.0 with the HC-* fixture families; its verdict left two P3 notes you must close: an \"ax-host/2\" same-family ALPN refusal vector in TestVerifyPeerRefusals, and a shortened-deadline hook for the ~10 s TestInvalidActivation/bad_destination vector). You are the primary implementation-conformance owner for the pinned v0.6.0 Section 11.10.4 / AC-HOST-001 product gate (\"Drive the real Config-4 launch and RPC-5 dispatch on supported SSH/platform lanes: full mutual TLS, exact enrolled certificate/UUID/hello, no preauthentication effects, migration/downgrade refusals, fresh-key rotation, revocation of idle/live streams within one second, expiry and concurrent mutation-generation fencing; exercise valid and invalid actual certificates, both role failures, stale/failed reads and recovery bypasses; model