/error_version_drift` | killed |\n121|| `truncated-dispatch-ignored` | one truncated dispatch frame skipped instead of unframeable close | `TestHostileDisconnectPhases/mid_request_close` | killed |\n122|| `snapshot-integrity` | corrupt store read as empty store | `TestHostileStaleReadsAreIntegrityFailures/corrupt_store` | killed |\n123|| `correlation-health` | miscorrelated `health.get` answer accepted | `TestHostileRecoveryBypass/response_id_mismatch_refused` | killed |\n124|| `nonce-static` | one constant hello nonce | `TestHostileReplayNonceFreshness` | killed |\n125|\n126|Gates without a new mutant name their covering probe: supplement exact-match\n127|(`match-leaf/match-root/match-spki/match-count`), trust-state\n128|(`state-revoked/state-retiring`), hello identity (`hello-id-server/client`),\n129|resumption (`tickets`), limiter (`handshake-cap`), CA bound (`ca-bound`),\n130|server generation (`stale-dispatch`), mutation rebind (`stale-mutation`).\n131|Replay refusal is TLS-1.3-intrinsic (stdlib owns the gate; ours are\n132|no-tickets/no-cache/fresh-nonce, all mutated). No new source-text-inspecting\n133|gate was added (the static census + its token-preserving evasion mutant are\n134|prior work, re-run green).\n135|\n136|## F. P3 notes from z1yxg9 — 2 of 2 closed\n137|\n138|| Note | Resolution |\n139||---|---|\n140|| Same-family `ax-host/2` ALPN refusal vector in `TestVerifyPeerRefusals` | Added `alpn-same-family` row + `alpn-same-family` mutant, killed |\n141|| Shortened-deadline hook for `TestInvalidActivation/bad_destination` | Explicit 500 ms overrides + < 2 s elapsed assertion |","final_result":true}}}
