probes (multi-file\n23|  plant support added for the dual-enforced line cap) + shipped harness.\n24|- `internal/hostchannel/verify_test.go`: `ax-host/2` same-family ALPN row (P3a).\n25|- `internal/hostchannel/refusal_test.go`: bad-destination deadline hook (P3b).\n26|- `internal/hostchannel/gates_test.go`: registry extended with the new vectors.\n27|- `internal/traceability/ownership.v0.6.0.json`: `AC-HOST-001` registered over\n28|  20 suite tests; new `unevidenced` bindings for 11.10.1–11.10.4 + 16.1;\n29|  6.6/11.10 gaps refreshed; 11.10.5 stays unowned by design; digest re-pinned.\n30|- `internal/traceability/traceability.go`: `reviewedOwnershipCanonicalSHA256`\n31|  re-pinned to `e327bb08…`; `main_test.go` + `traceability_test.go` report pins\n32|  updated (102 cases / 61 bindings / 8 unowned / 17/487 clauses).\n33|- `README.md` + `internal/hostchannel/README.md`: suite docs, test commands,\n34|  refreshed stated bounds; no capability claims (no `ax` command exists).\n35|- `LOGBOOK.md`: entry prepended.\n36|\n37|## Coverage ratios (production call site per row in the matrix)\n38|\n39|- Hostile rows: **7 of 7** driven (`Dial`/`Serve`/`Call`).\n40|- AC-HOST-001 rows: **14 of 15** fully driven; B8 (revocation ≤ 1 s) partial —\n41|  next-dispatch fence + `WatchGeneration` measured < 1 s, idle-without-traffic\n42|  self-close measured NOT satisfied (stated bound with log evidence).\n43|- HC-* families: **10 of 10** with positive + negative vectors.\n44|- P3 notes: **2 of 2** closed.\n45|- Narrowing mutants: **9 of 9** new probes killed by named tests; 26 prior\n46|  probes re-run (neutral passed, 24 killed, 1 documented harmless SURVIVED).\n47|\n48|## Validation (this worktree, exit codes observed)\n49|\n50|- `gofmt` check: clean. `go build ./...`: ok. `go vet ./...`: exit 0.\n51|- `go test ./... -count=1`: exit 0, 31 packages ok, 0 failures.\n52|- `go test ./... -race -count=1`: exit 0, 31 packages ok, no warnings.\n53|- `go test ./... -cover -count=1`: exit 0 (host